{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14107350","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14107350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410733101:":{"text":"おとなしくしろ！","source_cn":"老实点！<key:dialog42>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1AAC9F756E6561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410733102:":{"text":"くそ……","source_cn":"可恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F874984482DC30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1410733103:":{"text":"ほら行け！","source_cn":"过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BA4B4C6DE2A314","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410735001:0":{"text":"フリン、よくものこのことオレの前に姿を現しやがったな！","source_cn":"弗林……你这混球，还敢出现在我的面前！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB850644D8A8F5C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410735002:0":{"text":"貴様ら、何をしたのか分かっているのか！？","source_cn":"这些混蛋都做了什么好事！竟敢破坏我们两族的关系！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF38FCD27587869B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410735003:0":{"text":"ご安心ください、エイン様、この者どもは私の方で対処いたしますので。","source_cn":"奎茵大祭司，放心吧！我一定好好处理他们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4920D4F2AFBAD42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410735004:0":{"text":"フリン殿。陛下は外交の安定を願い、この二人の扱いをあなたに委ねました。","source_cn":"弗林先生，女王陛下担忧引起外交纠纷，所以特意将此二人转...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AA5F5B1553E530F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410735005:0":{"text":"国の外に出してしまった方が、何かと都合のいいこともある……そうでしょう？","source_cn":"希望您能明白她的苦心，毕竟有些事情不该在萨洛克兰发生……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C29BB623AD2BF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410735006:0":{"text":"もちろんですとも。後は私にお任せください。","source_cn":"明白明白，您放心就是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF4F48E0E7C5B88C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410735007:0":{"text":"けっ、白々しい！","source_cn":"呸，装模作样！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x328C904AD30DA4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410735008:0":{"text":"フリン殿、礼儀を知らないドワーフには、相応の教育が必要なようですね。","source_cn":"弗林先生，有些矮人不懂礼数，看来还需要好好管教。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D4F781AE292EFE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410735009:0":{"text":"おっしゃる通りでございます。必ずや、厳しく指導いたします。","source_cn":"大祭司说得对。回去后我一定好好……教训她。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x219056E4A66CAFCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410735010:0":{"text":"それでは、私はこの者たちを連れて村へ戻ります。後ほど改めて謝罪に伺いますので！","source_cn":"时候不早了，我们先带他们上去，之后再给您赔罪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50A0757E6BFECFB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1410735011:0":{"text":"よい知らせを期待していますよ。それでは。","source_cn":"那就期待您的好消息了，再会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x814FEDAC3868E904","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1410733101:":{"text":"おとなしくしろ！","source_cn":"老实点！<key:dialog42>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF1AAC9F756E6561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:22:1410733102:":{"text":"くそ……","source_cn":"可恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F874984482DC30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen